ght-dead-world-demo-on-android-design-lessons-from-a-tiny-zombie-survival-game-57eb">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Unreal Engine 5.4 建筑可视化优化：Draw Call 从 10000 压到 1200 以下</title><link>https://dev.to/atlyxen_studios/unreal-engine-54-archviz-optimization-slashing-draw-calls-from-10000-to-under-1200-mk9</link><description>从 Revit 等软件导出的建筑模型动辄上万次 Draw Call，作者用分层实例化静态网格批量合并重复构件，实测把大型场景稳定在 60 帧。</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:16:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">572d9fe3bb6fd46ddcb8f7bdd547f624d82eefac</guid><source url="https://dev.to/atlyxen_studios/unreal-engine-54-archviz-optimization-slashing-draw-calls-from-10000-to-under-1200-mk9">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>开发日志：做《NICHLYST》——敞开的门：33 个结局、32 项测试全过与一个诚实的保留意见</title><link>https://dev.to/koztechie/building-nichlyst-the-gate-that-stayed-open-33-endings-32-green-tests-one-honest-caveat-159b</link><description>作者在修好 704 个失败断言后，用一连串小而窄的检查验证了 33 个结局与双语字段等细节，最后坦言：阶段关卡虽全过，但设备端已知的启动报错仍未实测排除，绿色测试只证明它所证明的东西。</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:23:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d3b515350460890c97483bbe3593673b1907ce73</guid><source url="https://dev.to/koztechie/building-nichlyst-the-gate-that-stayed-open-33-endings-32-green-tests-one-honest-caveat-159b">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>留乡艺术家游戏创业指南：如何在未获得巨大成功的情况下经营工作室</title><link>https://indienova.com/indie-game-news/gdc-flopping-successfully-running-a-studio-without-a-huge-hit</link><description>GDC 2023 演讲译制：挪威视觉艺术家 Yngvill Hopen 分享没有爆款也能让工作室持续运转的经营经验。</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:31:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e8d5fff0c27fe19376481a168f15b154f7399c97</guid><source url="https://indienova.com/indie-game-news/gdc-flopping-successfully-running-a-studio-without-a-huge-hit">indienova 独立精神</source></item><item><title>为什么“优化过”的 GIF 会变成闹鬼精灵图（附 4 个 2D 游戏开发 Canvas 小修复）</title><link>https://dev.to/fancy39_9841cbc02f99f729c/why-optimized-gifs-turn-into-haunted-sprite-sheets-and-4-tiny-canvas-fixes-fo